{"id":"reference/Zig-Test","kind":"langref","title":"Zig 测试","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Zig-Test","file":"reference/Zig-Test.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Zig-Test","text":"Zig 测试"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Test-Declarations","text":"测试声明"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Doctests","text":"文档测试"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Test-Failure","text":"测试失败"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Skip-Tests","text":"跳过测试"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Report-Memory-Leaks","text":"报告内存泄漏"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Detecting-Test-Build","text":"检测测试构建"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Test-Output-and-Logging","text":"测试输出与日志"},{"depth":3,"slug":"The-Testing-Namespace","text":"测试命名空间"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Test-Tool-Documentation","text":"测试工具文档"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Zig-Test\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Zig-Test\">Zig 测试</a></h2>\n\n      <p>可以在一个或多个 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span></code> 声明内编写代码，用于确认行为符合预期：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">testing_introduction.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"expect addOne adds one to 41\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 标准库包含帮助编写测试的实用函数。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// `expect` 用于验证参数为 true。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 参数为 false 时会返回错误，表示测试失败。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// `try` 用于向测试运行器返回错误，通知它测试失败。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addOne</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 不过，多数情况下使用 `expectEqual` 等更具体的函数更方便。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 这样测试失败时会得到更清晰、更有帮助的错误信息。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addOne</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">addOne</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 测试名称也可以使用标识符。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 这是文档测试，用于说明 `addOne`。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addOne</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">/// 函数 `addOne` 将参数所给的数加一。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addOne</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">number</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">number</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test testing_introduction.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/2 testing_introduction.test.expect addOne adds one to 41...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2/2 testing_introduction.decltest.addOne...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">All 2 tests passed.</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p><code class=\"file\">testing_introduction.zig</code> 代码示例测试<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Functions\">函数</a> <code>addOne</code>，确认输入 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">41</span></code> 时返回 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">42</span></code>。从该测试的角度看，<code>addOne</code> 函数称为<em>被测代码</em>。</p>\n      <p><kbd>zig test</kbd> 是创建并运行测试构建的工具。默认情况下，它会构建并运行一个可执行程序，以 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Standard-Library/#Zig-Standard-Library\">Zig 标准库</a>提供的<em>默认测试运行器</em>作为主入口点。构建期间，在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Compilation-Model/#File-and-Declaration-Discovery\">解析</a>给定 Zig 源文件时发现的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span></code> 声明会纳入测试，由默认测试运行器执行并报告结果。</p>\n      <aside>本文档介绍 Zig 标准库提供的默认测试运行器的功能。其源码位于 <code class=\"file\">lib/compiler/test_runner.zig</code>。</aside>\n      <p>上面的命令行输出在 <kbd>zig test</kbd> 命令之后显示了两行内容。这些内容由默认测试运行器写入标准错误流：</p>\n      <dl>\n        <dt><samp>1/2 testing_introduction.test.expect addOne adds one to 41...</samp></dt>\n        <dd>这样的行表示总共多少个测试中正在执行哪一个。此处 <samp>1/2</samp> 表示共两个测试，正在运行第一个。注意，当测试运行器的标准错误流输出到终端时，测试成功后会清除相应行。</dd>\n        <dt><samp>2/2 testing_introduction.decltest.addOne...</samp></dt>\n        <dd>测试名称为标识符时，默认测试运行器显示 decltest 而不是 test。</dd>\n        <dt><samp>All 2 tests passed.</samp></dt>\n        <dd>这一行表示通过测试的总数。</dd>\n      </dl>\n      <h3 id=\"Test-Declarations\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Test-Declarations\">测试声明</a></h3>\n\n      <p>测试声明由<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Keyword-Reference/#Keyword-Reference\">关键字</a> <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span></code> 开始，随后是可选名称（写作<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#String-Literals-and-Unicode-Code-Point-Literals\">字符串字面量</a>或<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Identifiers/#Identifiers\">标识符</a>），最后是一个<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Blocks/#Blocks\">块</a>，其中可包含<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Functions\">函数</a>内部允许的任意合法 Zig 代码。</p>\n      <p>未命名的测试块在测试构建中始终运行，不受<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Skip-Tests\">跳过测试</a>规则影响。</p>\n      <p>测试声明与<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Functions\">函数</a>类似，具有返回类型和代码块。<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span></code> 的隐式返回类型固定为<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Union-Type\">错误联合类型</a> <code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code>，不可修改。未使用 <kbd>zig test</kbd> 工具构建 Zig 源文件时，测试声明不会纳入构建。</p>\n      <p>测试声明可以写在被测代码所在文件中，也可以写在独立的 Zig 源文件中。测试声明属于顶层声明，与顺序无关，可以位于被测代码之前或之后。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#The-Global-Error-Set\">全局错误集合</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Appendix/#Grammar\">语法</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      <h4 id=\"Doctests\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Doctests\">文档测试</a></h4>\n\n      <p>使用标识符命名的测试声明是<em>文档测试</em>。该标识符必须引用作用域内的另一条声明。与<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Comments/#Doc-Comments\">文档注释</a>类似，文档测试也是关联声明的说明，会出现在为该声明生成的文档中。</p>\n      <p>有效的文档测试应当自包含，并专注于被测试的声明，回答新用户可能对接口或预期用法产生的疑问，同时避免不必要或容易引起混淆的细节。文档测试不能替代文档注释，而是其补充与配套，提供可执行、以代码表达的示例，并由 <kbd>zig test</kbd> 验证。</p>\n      \n      \n      <h3 id=\"Test-Failure\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Test-Failure\">测试失败</a></h3>\n\n      <p>默认测试运行器会检查测试是否返回<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Errors\">错误</a>。测试返回错误即视为失败，并将其<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Return-Traces\">错误返回追踪</a>输出到标准错误流。全部测试结束后会报告失败总数。</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">testing_failure.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"expect this to fail\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">false</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"expect this to succeed\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">true</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test testing_failure.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/2 testing_failure.test.expect this to fail...FAIL (TestUnexpectedResult)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/testing.zig:584:14: 0x124c589 in expect (std.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">if (!ok) return error.TestUnexpectedResult;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code